  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* New graph style by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/serie/pull/184\r\n* Add graph antialias by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/serie/pull/185\r\n* Use cargo-sort-derives by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/serie/pull/186\r\n* Add commit marking by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/serie/pull/187\r\n* Update Ratatui to 0.30.2 by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/serie/pull/188\r\n* Remove text-to-png from dev dependencies by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/serie/pull/189\r\n* Remove dircpy from dev dependencies by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/serie/pull/190\r\n* Cache angular and curved edge drawing calculations by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/serie/pull/191\r\n* Simplify graph image regression tests by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/serie/pull/192\r\n* Add snapshot comparisons to graph row rendering tests by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/serie/pull/193\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/lusingander/serie/compare/v0.9.3...v0.10.0",
